# Where an agent may write with Edit, Write, MultiEdit or NotebookEdit in this
# repository. guard-paths refuses every other path (ADR 0039). One glob per
# line, relative to the repository root; `**` and `*` both span directories.
#
# Docs and tests only. The mechanism (hooks/, bin/, the trimtab/ package,
# skills/, agents/, commands/, templates/, routines/, systemd/, bootstrap.sh,
# settings.base.json) is the harness and is left out on purpose; the operator
# lifts this for harness work by exporting HOOK_ALLOW_HARNESS=1. This file
# cannot widen guard-paths' always-refused paths, and CODEOWNERS still
# reviews every path at merge.
tests/**
docs/adr/**
README.md
